     "c1c3a64c-ef4c-495e-a778-82c7744d55bd"], Cell[
    "All induced fiber graphs are mutually isomorphic", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"ab98e59d-d3a0-4eaf-93c9-0cfe8a4fb6e8"], Cell[
